=== ERRATUM (appended 2026-09-03, before hash registration) ===
The Traceback above is the SECOND crash of the detector block (first run: same
matmul error with unfixed windows; rerun: resid column slicing still missing).
Both crashes occurred AFTER draw 2000/2000 was checkpointed to
heat59_lam_all_partial.npy (crash-safe save every 250 draws), so no draws were
lost. Statistics [2]/[3] were completed from the checkpoint by
heat59b_complete_stats.py, which also found and fixed a second latent bug in the
never-executed lines (|A2|,|A1| summed over theta, collapsing the pre-registered
per-frequency resolution). Statistic [1] re-verified identical from the
checkpoint. Both fixes are disclosed in heat59b_complete_stats.py docstring and
in this script's ERRATUM comment. Hash target written by heat59b:
heat59_gue_lambda_ensemble.results.pkl
